{"seq":46,"slug":"authentication-authorization","title":"认证与授权","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 认证与授权\n\n打开任何一个需要登录的系统，背后都站着两个分工明确的守门人：一个负责确认「你是谁」，另一个负责裁定「你能做什么」。前者是认证（authentication），后者是授权（authorization）。它们常被并称、被简写成 authN 与 authZ，却是两套独立演进、各有标准与失败模式的机制。把它们混为一谈，正是无数安全事故的源头——一个把用户身份核对得严丝合缝的系统，仍可能因为没有在每次取数据时校验归属，而让任意用户读走他人的订单。\n\n这个 hub 按照一条从地基到屋顶的路径组织，分四章层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」铺设概念地基。先厘清认证与授权的边界、主体与资源的关系，再深入凭证的种类与多因素的组合逻辑，最后讲清登录之后状态如何延续——会话与令牌这两条技术路线的取舍。没有这一章，后面的协议和模型都会悬空。\n\n第二章「协议标准」把基础落到工业级的互操作规范上。OAuth 2.1 解决「如何安全地委托访问」，OpenID Connect 在其上补齐「如何标准化地传递身份」，JWT 则是承载这一切声明的自描述令牌格式。这三者环环相扣，是今天几乎所有第三方登录与 API 授权的事实标准。\n\n第三章「授权模型」回到「能做什么」这个问题，展开成一门独立的学问。从最常见的 RBAC 角色模型，到更灵活的 ABAC 属性模型，再到把权限交给外部策略引擎统一裁决、用 ReBAC 关系图谱建模复杂共享场景，最后落到 API 这一最易出错的授权战场。\n\n第四章「实践与安全」把前三章组装进真实系统。身份提供方与单点登录是企业落地的形态，常见漏洞与防护是必须背下的攻防清单，零信任与最小权限则是统领全局的现代安全哲学——它不再相信网络边界，而是把每一次访问都当作不可信，逐次验证。\n\n四章之间不是孤立的：协议是基础概念的工程化，授权模型决定了协议里令牌该携带什么，而实践与安全则是检验前三章是否真的站得住的试金石。读完整个 hub，你应能独立设计一套既正确又可维护的身份与访问控制方案。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"authn-authz-overview","title":"认证与授权概念","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/foundations/authn-authz-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"credentials-factors","title":"凭证与多因素","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/foundations/credentials-factors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sessions-tokens","title":"会话与令牌","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/foundations/sessions-tokens"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"protocols","title":"协议标准","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"oauth2","title":"OAuth 2.1 授权框架","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/protocols/oauth2"},{"seq":2,"slug":"openid-connect","title":"OpenID Connect 身份层","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/protocols/openid-connect"},{"seq":3,"slug":"jwt-tokens","title":"JWT 与令牌格式","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/protocols/jwt-tokens"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"authorization","title":"授权模型","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/authorization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rbac-abac","title":"RBAC 与 ABAC","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/authorization/rbac-abac"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-engines","title":"策略引擎与 ReBAC","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/authorization/policy-engines"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-access-control","title":"API 访问控制","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/authorization/api-access-control"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践与安全","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-providers-sso","title":"身份提供方与 SSO","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/practice/identity-providers-sso"},{"seq":2,"slug":"common-vulnerabilities","title":"常见漏洞与防护","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/practice/common-vulnerabilities"},{"seq":3,"slug":"zero-trust","title":"零信任与最小权限","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/authentication-authorization/practice/zero-trust"}]}]}